# Non-secret config shared by ALL sandboxes. sandcastle's resolveEnv merges every
# key here into every sandbox, so DO NOT put auth tokens in this file (they would
# leak to both the z.ai and anthropic sandboxes → wrong token → 401).
# Auth tokens live in .env.secrets (gitignored); main.ts bakes exactly one per
# sandbox, picked from the active model profile (SANDCASTLE_PROFILE).
# See docs/adr/0001-sandcastle-cross-provider-split.md and
# docs/adr/0002-sandcastle-model-profiles.md.
GH_TOKEN=
